  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Tuʻunga totonu: ngaahi talotalo fakatotolo tauʻatāina, ngaahi fokotuʻu polokolo, mo ha ʻahiʻahi vaʻinga taʻupu.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Kuo fakatonutonu ha tuʻunga tefito muʻa: Belgium (BE) he taimi ni ʻoku fakalele ki he Tati kae ʻikai ki he Falanisē — ko e kau lea Flemish ko e tokolahi ʻo e fonua (~60%) ʻi he kau lea Walloon Falanisē (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Kuo fakatonutonu ha tuʻunga tefito muʻa: Kazakhstan (KZ) he taimi ni ʻoku fakalele ki he Kazak kae ʻikai ki he Lūsia, koeʻuhi kuo ʻi ai ni ha liliu lea faka-Kazak — ko e faʻahinga fakatonutonu tatau mo e fakatonutonu muʻa ʻo Belgium.",
