  "Turns declared rights into executable licensing: quote, pay, verify, audit, revoke.": "Liliu ʻa e ngaahi totonu kuo fakahā ke hoko ko ha laiseni lava ke fakahoko: fakatuʻunga totongi, totongi, sivi, sivi kakato, fakaʻikaiʻi.",
  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "ʻOku moʻui fakakātoa ha lea ʻe uofulu: Pilitānia, Siaina Muʻa, Siaina Faingofua, Sapani, Kōlea, Falanisē, Siamane, Sepani, Potukali, Lūsia, ʻAlepea, Tosia, Peasia, Penikali, Hini, ʻInitonisia, Vietinami, Kalisi, ʻĪtali, Tati.",
  "Two license tiers: a free public tier and a contact-based commercial tier.": "Tuʻunga Laiseni ʻe Ua: ha tuʻunga fakalūkufua taʻetotongi mo ha tuʻunga fakapisinisi makatuʻunga ʻi ha fetuʻutaki.",
  "UI": "Feituʻu Fakaʻaonga",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "ʻOku lau ʻe he ngaahi hala AI ʻa e ʻatā taʻe fakapau ko ha taʻepau fakalao pea ʻoku fakamaʻa liʻaki; ko e tuku pē kuo fakapolokoloʻi mo lava ke lau ʻe he masini ʻoku ne fakahoko ai ʻa e fakamatala ke lava moʻoni ke ako mei ai.",
