  "Verified in both LTR and RTL contexts: the panel mirrors correctly for Arabic and Persian without any special-casing, using logical CSS positioning.": "Kuo Fakamoʻoniʻi ʻi he ongo potufolofola LTR mo RTL: ʻoku fakatātā totonu ʻa e panel ki he ʻAlepea mo e Peasia taʻe ha founga makehe, ʻo ngāueʻaki ha tuʻunga CSS fakafisi.",
